返回 `<a href="../../interceptor/CacheResolver.html" title="interface in org.springframework.cache.interceptor"><code>CacheResolver</code></a>` Bean 以用于解析注解驱动的缓存管理中的异常缓存。实现必须显式声明`<a href="../../../context/annotation/Bean.html" title="annotation interface in org.springframework.context.annotation"><code>@Bean</code></a>`，例如：
<pre class="code">@Configuration
@EnableCaching
public class AppConfig implements JCacheConfigurer {
    @Bean // important!
    @Override
    public CacheResolver exceptionCacheResolver() {
        // configure and return CacheResolver instance
    }
    // ...
}
</pre>
有关更完整的示例，请参见`<a href="../../annotation/EnableCaching.html" title="annotation interface in org.springframework.cache.annotation"><code>EnableCaching</code></a>`。
